        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943180/extras/79443477ff6e236b3217fd039624734c.poster.avif?t=1787511127\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943180/extras/79443477ff6e236b3217fd039624734c.webm?t=1787511127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943180/extras/79443477ff6e236b3217fd039624734c.mp4?t=1787511127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ever Wanted to Play a Platformer like no other? well heres the game! Welcome to DAVBOT a 2D Platformer that seems to be like no other... right? Well we got robots here! :D </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Besides all that DAVBOT Brings some Unique Challenges to the mix, can you escape for freedom? let see you try.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Game Features:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer - Play through 14 Chapters to learn DAVBOTs Story (In progress)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Editor (Coming at a Later Update)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >User Created Levels (Coming at a Later Update)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra Stuff that brings old to the new. (In progress)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943180/extras/79443477ff6e236b3217fd039624734c.poster.avif?t=1787511127\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943180/extras/79443477ff6e236b3217fd039624734c.webm?t=1787511127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943180/extras/79443477ff6e236b3217fd039624734c.mp4?t=1787511127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ever Wanted to Play a Platformer like no other? well heres the game! Welcome to DAVBOT a 2D Platformer that seems to be like no other... right? Well we got robots here! :D </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Besides all that DAVBOT Brings some Unique Challenges to the mix, can you escape for freedom? let see you try.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Game Features:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer - Play through 14 Chapters to learn DAVBOTs Story (In progress)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Editor (Coming at a Later Update)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >User Created Levels (Coming at a Later Update)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra Stuff that brings old to the new. (In progress)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
